zes were they?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:        Freezies and pops! The taste of summer!", "time": "36400", "id": 3}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about friendships and relationships.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about future action.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about habits in the past.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Did you have many friends as a kid?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What did you use to do with your friends when you were a kid?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Do you still see these friends now?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " Let's talk about childhood memories!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "STI", "questions": [{"responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0, "correct": 0, "selected": 0}, {"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 1, "correct": 1, "selected": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " \nPeter shares some memories about <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">the good old days</span>.\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content